<p>Thanks a lot for the feedback.</p>
<p>I had other ideas for this article's expansion, but I omitted them because I feared that the end result would simply be too long. It's quite long for a relatively simple idea already.</p>
<p>I have a scrapped incident log I could revise and include. It was about the -As interacting with one another in ways that coincide with the Charles Elton food chain model. Do you think that would be more interesting material?</p>
<p><strong>EDIT:</strong> Image sources, site image policy.</p>
