														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2810578">
									

<p>This went on at far too much length for my liking. The tropes (abandoned amusement park, masks that turn you into what they represent, weird animal hybrid is a killing/raping machine) aren't used to any great effect - there are no real surprises or character development to keep me engaged.</p>
<p>I'd suggest distilling this down to the core story idea you want to get across, and then reworking it to focus more clearly on that idea. Too much of this is unnecessary and killing the pacing.</p>

